# OmniRoute — Build Walkthrough

## What Was Built

A complete **Dynamic Edge-to-Cloud Router** — an intelligent middleware API that intercepts AI requests (text generation and object detection) and dynamically routes them between Cloud (Gemini API) and Edge (MLX + YOLOv8) based on real-time system telemetry.

### Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend
        UI["Dashboard UI<br>(HTML/CSS/JS)"]
    end
    
    subgraph Backend["FastAPI Backend"]
        API["/v1/process<br>Unified API"]
        TEL["Telemetry Engine<br>(ping, battery, RAM)"]
        RC["Routing Controller<br>(threshold matrix)"]
    end
    
    subgraph Cloud["☁️ Cloud"]
        CT["Gemini 2.0 Flash<br>(Text)"]
        CV["Gemini Vision<br>(Detection)"]
    end
    
    subgraph Edge["🖥️ Edge"]
        ET["MLX Llama 3.2 1B<br>(4-bit quantized)"]
        EV["YOLOv8 Nano<br>(OpenCV)"]
    end
    
    UI -->|POST /v1/process| API
    UI -->|GET /v1/telemetry| TEL
    API --> RC
    RC -->|"ping < 50ms<br>battery > 20%"| Cloud
    RC -->|"offline or<br>ping > 150ms"| Edge
    CT --> API
    CV --> API
    ET --> API
    EV --> API
```

